  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.13,
      239.77,
      402.4,
      261.88
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.13,
      269.77,
      402.39,
      291.88
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Notaries (Amendment)Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.13,
      299.77,
      402.46,
      376.84
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 28 of the Notaries Ordinance (Chapter 107)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in subsection (1A) thereof, by the substitution forthe words \u201cRegistrar of Lands.\u201d, of the words and figures\u201cRegistrar of Lands and that any sum of money, if any hasbeen imposed by the Registrar General in terms of section 35,has been paid.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.13,
      384.85,
      402.35,
      406.84
    ],
